# Allowlist for `mypy.stubtest`, read by scripts/run-all-checks.sh and CI.
#
# The only supported import is "from vicar import ...", so __init__.pyi is the only
# stub and describes the whole public API. The modules below are implementation detail
# and deliberately carry no stub; stubtest reports each one as "failed to find stubs",
# which this file accepts. Nothing else is accepted: a public name missing from the
# stub still fails the check.
vicar\.vicarlabel
vicar\.vicarimage
